1
00:00:00,032 --> 00:00:01,302
(Raj:)Look, we admit it.

2
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,870
(Raj:)The idea that you guys came
up with was really good,

3
00:00:03,869 --> 00:00:05,839
(Raj:)and I'd love
your help.

4
00:00:05,838 --> 00:00:08,868
(Howard:)I suppose it couldn't have been
easy for you to say that.

5
00:00:08,874 --> 00:00:11,814
(Raj:)It wasn't, so...
are you in?

6
00:00:13,545 --> 00:00:14,875
(Sheldon:)Certainly.
Sure.
Great.

7
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,180
(Leonard:)Now that we're all
on the same page,

8
00:00:17,183 --> 00:00:19,113
(Leonard:)let's get together tonight
and work on it.

9
00:00:19,118 --> 00:00:20,288
"Get together tonight"?

10
00:00:20,286 --> 00:00:21,786
(Sheldon:)Leonard, stop trying
to control everything,

11
00:00:21,787 --> 00:00:24,417
(Sheldon:)and give poor Raj a chance to
come up with what we should do.

12
00:00:24,423 --> 00:00:25,593
(Sheldon:)Go ahead, Raj.

13
00:00:25,591 --> 00:00:27,421
(Raj:)Okay, I think
we should do it right now.

14
00:00:27,426 --> 00:00:28,796
(Sheldon:)Tonight works better for me.

15
00:00:28,794 --> 00:00:31,124
(Leonard:)Okay.

16
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,930
(sighs)

17
00:00:36,936 --> 00:00:39,436
Okay, it's just an audition.

18
00:00:39,438 --> 00:00:41,108
Why am I nervous?

19
00:00:41,107 --> 00:00:42,477
Maybe it's a good thing.

20
00:00:42,475 --> 00:00:44,375
Just means I want it.

21
00:00:44,376 --> 00:00:45,946
And I can have it.

22
00:00:45,945 --> 00:00:47,375
This feels right.

23
00:00:47,379 --> 00:00:49,409
Why did I ever give this up?

24
00:00:53,551 --> 00:00:59,021
(Penny(voiceover):)I'm starting to remember.

